  "body": "Light, bright and just moments from the beach - welcome to easy Mairangi Bay living.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new apartment combines contemporary style with a relaxed coastal feel.\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms, 2 stylish bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Sunny open-plan living flowing to a generous deck\r\n\r\n• Designer kitchen with Gaggenau appliances\r\n\r\n• Sea views from selected apartments\r\n\r\n• 1-2 secure garage car parks\r\n\r\n• Lift access, air-conditioning & smart security\r\n\r\nWalk to the beach, cafés, restaurants, shops and coastal tracks, then come home to a space that’s modern, secure and wonderfully easy to live in.\r\n\r\nLock up, head out and enjoy the lifestyle.",
